# local mirror of the VPS feed-proxy — holds the host/IP + keys, never publish
proxy/
# LOCAL-ONLY tests. The farm's extraction is site-agnostic, but proving a labelling/extraction rule sometimes
# needs the real hosts, titles and URL shapes of the sites people actually reel — which do not belong in a
# public repo. Those cases live in *.local_test.js beside the module they test, and the committed suite keeps
# the same shapes on neutral hosts. Run them by hand: `deno test -A packages/runtime/sitelabel.local_test.js`.
*.local_test.js
# agent bridge files — machine-local mirrors of the owner's private skill rules
# (absolute home paths, private-repo references); same reason as .claude/skills/
AGENTS.md
.serena/
# 8n8 run stamps — a green-gates record is about THIS machine and THIS tree, never shared
.8n8/
